# Installation command

Use Docker Compose to install and manage oneAgent services in traditional servers.

Execute on the server to be monitored:
1. Download the configuration file
2. Download the deployment package and execute the installation command

## 1.Download the configuration file

```bash
curl -Lo installCfg.sh \
    http://{{ .apoCollector.collectorGatewayAddr }}:{{ default .apoCollector.ports.apoBackend 31363 }}/api/integration/cluster/install/config?clusterId={{ .id}}
```

## 2.Download the deployment package and execute the installation command

Use the following command to download the deployment package and install

```bash
curl -Lo apo-one-agent-compose-amd64-{{ ._deploy_version }}.tgz \
    https://apo-ce.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/apo-one-agent-compose-amd64-{{ ._deploy_version }}.tgz

bash ./installCfg.sh
```
